#chip tiny202, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): 1 hour at 20 MHz = 72,000,000,000 cycles. A single-precision clock value once made this 4096 cycles short.
'Expect: compiles, and the Repeat For construct runs exactly the requested number of clock cycles (cycle-accurate simulation)

#option explicit
Repeat For 1 h
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
